    2 N      -2.542   -4.389    0.069   -2.760   -4.192    0.047   -2.575   -4.735   -0.310   -0.379
    3 Si     -8.999   -2.914    2.088   -9.038   -3.182    1.780   -8.996   -2.632    2.372    0.285
